144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Throughout the past year, WXPR remained a trusted source for news, music, and connection across northern Wisconsin and the Upper Peninsula. In a time of change and uncertainty, we stood steady, committed to serving our community with integrity, creativity, and heart.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This year, we shared stories that go beyond the headlines that reflect the depth, resilience, and humanity of the Northwoods. We brought the voices of youth, tribal leaders, small business owners, scientists, educators, and artists to the airwaves, where they could be heard, honored, and celebrated. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our news team worked tirelessly to deliver in-depth, local reporting on the issues that matter most-public health, the arts, the local economy, environmental policy, and more. During the 2024 election season, we produced a comprehensive, nonpartisan voter guide and expanded our coverage to help listeners feel informed, empowered, and confident when casting their votes at the ballot box.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
