149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To our members: thank you. Your support, encouragement, and belief in the power of local public radio make this work possible and meaningful.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As we look ahead, we do so with hope and determination. The media landscape may be shifting, but our purpose is clear. The need for music, for trusted local journalism, and for authentic storytelling has never been greater and WXPR is ready to meet that moment, with you by our side.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
